WEBVTT

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.601
A mover owns trucks.

00:00:03.601 --> 00:00:07.050
A broker sells your move to someone you've never met.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:08.353
So ask.

00:00:08.353 --> 00:00:10.800
Are you the mover, or a broker?

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:16.795
Then get the USDOT number, and look it up yourself, on the federal site.

00:00:16.795 --> 00:00:18.325
Not a link they send.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.157
Never sign with a blank total.

00:00:21.157 --> 00:00:23.580
And never stay on the line to sign.

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:26.077
Mover or broker?

00:00:26.077 --> 00:00:27.058
Find out first.

00:00:27.058 --> 00:00:28.498
packedrabbit.com.

00:00:28.498 --> 00:00:33.405
If this helped, like it, share it with someone who's moving, and subscribe.
